% holding-blocked: The original is fully notated, the words fit every note and the listening link is Fela Kuti's official channel, but nobody has tried it with students. A Grade 1 classroom teacher must trial the call-and-response timing and the bars 1-2 groove as a layer at 84-100; a Nigerian or Afrobeat-informed music educator must review the context and respect notes; a second score reader must check the notes, words and cues.
